      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DARCY MAC (1) last seen when scorching around the 330m at Temora in 18.64 for a nose victory. Hard to top on the time from last start. CAWBOURNE JEMMA (4) comes off an average performance last start when eighth at this track over 320m behind King Of Asgard (19.35) in a Grade 4/5. Got the money at her only try from this box. Better than last start and can bounce back. BRONTE LEE (8) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 23.05 beating Stew Bob. Has never missed the frame from eight starts from this draw, including five wins. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. CAWBOURNE MAXX (2) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (18.86) in a Grade 5 over 320m at this track.",
